<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank offers quick repo at 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank offers quick repo at 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Wednesday it was offering a quick securities repurchase agreement, or repo, at a fixed rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said the tender would run from March 26 to March 28 and that bids have to be in by 1000 GMT today. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 256</p>
